OL,3,GNEWSAJudges reject bid to increase
OL,4,Asentences for teens convicted of racist
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudges have rejected a bid to increase
OL,8,Fthe jail sentence of two teenagers who
OL,9,Fmurdered a man delivering groceries to
OL,10,Fhis mother in an unprovoked racist
OL,11,Fattack.
OL,13,FMarcus Staniforth, 18, had been found
OL,14,Fguilty of Kamran Aman's murder and
OL,15,Freceived a sentence of 17 years in
OL,16,Fprison, while a 16-year-old who cannot
OL,17,Fbe named for legal reasons had received
OL,18,Fa sentence to 15 years in prison.
OL,20,FTheir sentences had been referred to
OL,21,Fthe Court of Appeal to see if they had
OL,22,Fbeen unduly lenient.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
